* Objects taken out of the world (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our own
* script). Run by openc2e after the world loads (Additions folder), every
* load, and safe to repeat.

* The five power-up medallions, classifiers 2 9 16-20 (the game's sprite
* powp): spinning game-state switches for features openc2e already has
* on, so they only get in the way. At x 4061 y 761, 8029/1230, 4317/1470,
* 126/2222, 8298/967; the wall behind each is whole.
enum 2 9 16 kill targ next
enum 2 9 17 kill targ next
enum 2 9 18 kill targ next
enum 2 9 19 kill targ next
enum 2 9 20 kill targ next

* The under-floor sweeper, 2 20 14 (the game's sprite dos2): a critter that
* walks inside the ground under the east-garden soil (rooms 15-17, floor
* lines about 70 px above the rooms' bottoms) to clear away objects that
* fall below the floors. openc2e now lifts a moving object that is under its
* room's floor line back onto it, so nothing collects down there, and the
* sweeper itself would be lifted into view.
enum 2 20 14 kill targ next

* The cacti the world starts with (owner): the game's cactus plants 2 15 1
* (sprite cact) and 2 15 4 (cac2), and the cactus seeds 2 21 6 (cac2), in
* the desert above the incubator and elsewhere.
enum 2 15 1 kill targ next
enum 2 15 4 kill targ next
enum 2 21 6 kill targ next
